<title>SWEDEN: Astra 9 mo sales by unit and product.</title>
<headline>Astra 9 mo sales by unit and product.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the sales by division by Swedish drug company Astra in the nine months ending September 30, 1996, compared with a year earlier.</p>
<p> DIVISION			   (Million crowns)</p>
<p> Gastrointestinal		12,875  vs 11,536</p>
<p> Respiratory			5,394  vs  5,284</p>
<p> Cardiovascular		   5,044  vs  4,697</p>
<p> Anaesthetics		     2,402  vs  2,605</p>
<p> Anti-infective		     808  vs    888</p>
<p> Medical devices		    440  vs    441</p>
<p> Other products		   1,174  vs  1,225</p>
<p> TOTAL			     28,137  vs 26,676</p>
<p>KEY PRODUCTS (Own sales)</p>
<p> Losec			     12,735  vs 11,401</p>
<p> Pulmicort			  3,316  vs  3,220</p>
<p> Seloken			    1,867  vs  1,789</p>
<p> Xylocaine			  1,341  vs  1,524</p>
<p> Plendil			    1,406  vs  1,269</p>
<p> Bricanyl			     914  vs    908</p>
<p> Rhinocort			    759  vs    695</p>
<p> Imdur				  613  vs    528</p>
<p> Marcaine			     462  vs    476</p>
<p> Foscavir			     328  vs    302</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
